# | Finder 7M24 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: finder-7m24-7m38-modbus-protocol.pdf
# | - Single-phase DIN-rail energy meter with RS485 Modbus.
# | - Input registers (FC04), IEEE-754 float (T_float), big-endian (MSW first).
# | - Using the IEEE-754 float section (registers 32480–32645) for simplest integration.
# | - Protocol addresses = register_number − 30001.
# | - Energy counters: n1=active import (Wh), n2=reactive import (varh),
# | n3=active export (Wh), n4=reactive export (varh).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=21, baud=9600, 8N2.
